          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Maximize teamwork</span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Obtain information to help quickly treat STEMI, stroke and other patients</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Receive EMS data to help you know what to expect before patients arrive</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Easily assemble and brief care teams in advance</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Apr 24 2024 14:17:20 GMT+0000",
