          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Mobilize data on the go</span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Capture minute-by-minute transmission/reception history</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Immediately transfer data for efficient post-event QA/QI</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Enhance reporting for quality improvement</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
